From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 18:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] e200: add on-board readsb ADS-B decoder

Disable Charon in the E200 image and add a headless readsb package using
the local Pluto/IIO backend. Decode E200 S12/16 I/Q samples on the ARM
CPU and expose Beast, HTTP API and JSON services over Ethernet. Keep
iiod from competing for the local IIO buffer and handle refill errors
without corrupting sample accounting. Start ADS-B automatically at boot;
the user can still switch between ADS-B and the normal iiod service with
adsb-control.
---
